sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 用户
    participant FE as 🖥️ 前端 Next.js
    participant BE as ⚙️ AgentHub 后端
    participant DS as 🤖 下游 Agent
    participant FS as 📁 Filesystem

    Note over User,FS: === 一、用户发送消息 ===
    User->>FE: 输入文本 + @mention
    FE->>BE: POST /api/sessions/:id/messages
    BE->>BE: 校验会话状态
    BE->>BE: 创建 UserMessage + AgentRun
    BE-->>FE: WebSocket hub:message 推送
    BE-->>FE: REST 响应 {session, message, run}
    FE->>FE: 消息显示在时间线

    Note over User,FS: === 二、下游编排 ===
    BE->>DS: Socket.IO 连接下游
    BE->>DS: ACP session/initialize
    DS-->>BE: downstreamSessionId
    BE->>BE: 构建上下文快照 (ContextService)
    BE->>DS: ACP session/prompt
    DS-->>BE: {status: accepted}
    DS->>DS: Git worktree + Claude Code CLI

    Note over User,FS: === 三、Agent 执行 & 事件回流 ===
    loop Agent 执行中
        DS-->>BE: message.delta (文本增量)
        BE->>BE: 缓冲合并
        BE-->>FE: WebSocket hub:event 实时推送
        DS-->>BE: file.change (文件变更)
        BE->>BE: 持久化 FileChange
        BE-->>FE: WebSocket hub:file_change
        DS-->>BE: artifact.upsert/completed
        BE->>BE: 产物存储 (OSS)
        BE-->>FE: WebSocket hub:artifact
        FE->>FE: 更新 Diff/Artifact 面板
    end
    DS-->>BE: run.completed
    BE-->>FE: WebSocket session 更新
    FE->>FE: 解锁 composer

    Note over User,FS: === 四、文件系统直连 (并行) ===
    FE->>BE: GET /sessions/:id/sandbox/filesystem
    BE-->>FE: {downstreamSessionId}
    FE->>FS: Socket.IO /filesystem 直连
    FE->>FS: fs:list + fs:read 建基线
    FS-->>DS: Agent 修改文件
    FS-->>FE: fs:changed 推送
    FE->>FE: 对比基线生成 Diff
    FE->>FS: fs:update 保存编辑
